-----------------------------

This file records the project's current understanding and the precautions
taken. It is not legal advice and does not claim complete compliance; items
still requiring legal review are listed in licensing/LEGAL_REVIEW_REQUIRED.md.

This work is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. It is an educational
and reference tool. It is not a medical device and must not be used for
diagnosis, treatment or any other clinical purpose.
